Package: ggyoudraw
Title: 'You Draw It' Charts for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Arne", "Coutteau", , "c_arne@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Lets readers finish a line chart themselves before the real
    data are revealed, in the style of the 'You Draw It' charts of The New
    York Times. Provides a 'ggplot2' layer, geom_you_draw_line(), and
    you_draw_it(), which turns the plot into an interactive 'htmlwidget'
    built on 'ggiraph'. The widget works in the viewer, in 'R Markdown' and
    'Quarto' documents and in 'shiny' apps, where the reader's guesses come
    back as an input.
